{"title":"Booking Links & Sales Assets"}
</properties>
<content>
<callout icon="🔗" color="gray_bg">
	Everything you send a prospect lives here. Send the right link, book to the right calendar, use the approved proof only.
</callout>
## Links
- **Book-a-call funnel:** [mbemultiaccounting.com/apply](https://mbemultiaccounting.com/apply)
- **Community / Discord:** [discord.gg/mbe](https://discord.gg/mbe)
- **Closer booking:** leads are booked onto the closer's iClosed calendar (link provided by your manager).
- **Payment:** closes are collected through the Fanbasis payment link (provided by your manager).
## Sales assets (what you're allowed to send)
- Approved proof only: Kaden's operation screen recordings and verified client wins (from the Case Studies page).
- Booked leads get the pre-call page on the funnel's call-booked step.
<callout icon="🛡️" color="red_bg">
	Only send approved assets. Never send raw sales-call recordings or internal training. Never send "proof" with numbers that aren't Kaden's or a verified client's.
</callout>
</content>
